The search results confirm that the Volkswagen Golf GTI TCR is based on the Mk7.5 generation and was produced around 2019-2020. It is considered the "most recent version" of the TCR nameplate as there isn't a Mk8 Golf GTI TCR. I will evaluate the Mk7.5 GTI TCR based on the available data relative to today's market benchmarks.

